	(text "GPIO45 = VDD_SPI select, must read 0 at reset (3.3 V flash): 100k on the BUZZ gate is on the ui sheet (R56).\nGPIO46 must be 0/float at reset: 100k on RGB_DIN is on the ui sheet (R55).\nGPIO3 (CHG_INT_N, 10k pull-up R8): JTAG-source strap, ignored while the JTAG_SEL eFuse is unburnt."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
